        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our FaaS product, we offer certain back-office factoring services to the over-the-road transportation industry, enabling our FaaS customers to either supplement their own factoring operations or to offer factoring services to their customers wholly supported by our platform.",
        "start_character": 4121,
        "end_character": 4407
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our product lines offered on a nationwide basis, we typically maintain sales personnel across the country with designated regional responsibilities for clients within their territories.",
        "start_character": 32422,
        "end_character": 32611
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our treasury management operations generate fee income for us, while also enhancing our core deposit portfolio, as we are able to offer our commercial lending clients a full-service banking relationship meeting all of their business needs.",
        "start_character": 9736,
        "end_character": 9975
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The combination of these products that are offered to our clients in the transportation industry, specifically over the road trucking, when coupled together with our other products and services, such as personal and small business checking, treasury management, insurance brokerage, and fuel cards, position us to provide a complete suite of products and services to this market, ranging from owner-operators to sizable fleets, that we believe is unique in the market in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 12964,
        "end_character": 13452
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These products and services focus on serving the local communities in which we operate and creating full banking relationships with both personal and commercial clients.",
        "start_character": 8611,
        "end_character": 8780
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our commercial banking and treasury management functionality, we are able to offer our mortgage warehouse clients depository relationships focused on the servicing deposits generated in such businesses, further enhancing our core deposit portfolio.",
        "start_character": 17949,
        "end_character": 18205
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our wholly owned bank subsidiary, TBK Bank, we offer traditional banking services, commercial lending product lines focused on businesses that require specialized financial solutions and national lending product lines that further diversify our lending operations.",
        "start_character": 2239,
        "end_character": 2511
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through this branch network, we offer our customers a variety of financial products and services that both augment our revenue (fee and interest income) and help us expand and retain our core deposit network, including checking and savings accounts, debit cards, and electronic banking.",
        "start_character": 9295,
        "end_character": 9581
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer commercial loans that focus on serving clients requiring more specialized financial products and services on a national basis and across a variety of industries, with a particular focus on clients in the transportation industry.",
        "start_character": 12721,
        "end_character": 12963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer data services through our Intelligence offerings.",
        "start_character": 805,
        "end_character": 868
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are led by an experienced core management team with substantial experience in the markets that we serve and the financial products that we offer.",
        "start_character": 80782,
        "end_character": 80930
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001539638-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001539638-26-000007-f82093340448dab7",
        "accession_number": "0001539638-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
